\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\loch\af44\insrsid1184627 \hich\af45\dbch\af52\loch\f44 
This means that nmrshiftdb2 consists of Java classes, which get integrated into the jetspeed framework and are deployed on a server. The application needs access to a mySql server. The source code of nmrshiftdb2 is hosted on sourceforge. If 
\hich\af45\dbch\af52\loch\f44 you do not yet have it available and want seriously start to develop on nmrshiftdb2, you should first check out the code. The command checkout is:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid1184627 
