\hich\af45\dbch\af52\loch\f44 
c/sql contains sql scripts for building an empty database, also not handled by ant. nmrshifdb/src/deploymentdescriptors contains a deployment descriptor for the user count web service used by the loadbalancing mechanism (DeployGreeter.xml). It is used by 
\hich\af45\dbch\af52\loch\f44 t\hich\af45\dbch\af52\loch\f44 he ant task deployWebServices, which deploys this web service to apache soap. There are also more complex web services in NMRShiftDB.wdl/wsdd, installation is optional.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
